sked a shop owner.\\n\\nThe old man gave a nod. \\u201cWhat do you seek?\\u201d\\n\\n\\u201cA home.\\u201d\\n\\nThe shop owner led him past a calm bay to a hut by the sand. An old lamp hung by the door.\\n\\n\\u201cStay here,\\u201d the owner told him. \\u201cNo fee.\\u201d\\n\\nThe man gazed at the sea. For the first time in years, he felt at peace.\\n\\n\\u201cThanks,\\u201d he murmured.\\n\\nThat eve, he lit the lamp and watched the sun sink low. The town had no fame, yet to him, it felt like a true home.\", \"checks\": {\"0:keywords:letter_frequency\": false}}", "raw_metrics": {"pass_rate": {"contractDigest": "sha256:79df20ec4f4d16679ad9cae7de9a0bcc3b755edb113dc05a4458219aa4e62f53", "unit": "ratio", "status": "available", "value": 0, "evidenceRefs": ["sha256:62a0b467eb727a663ad3346befbfbf8d4e5247f5ad611b178a3963fe947446fc"]}}}}}], "data": {"prompt_path": "AGENTS.md", "current_prompt": "Follow all instructions in the user's request. Return only the requested answer.", "target_characters": 1000, "constraints": {"kind": "module", "entrypoint": "gear.search.constraints:PromptConstraints", "params": {"max_characters": 1800}, "children": {}, "source_dependencies": [], "package_dependencies": [], "resources": [], "state_schema_version": 1}}}

