from the grass. \\u201cDownstream, toward home.\\u201d\\n\\nTom looked back at the cold farm, the bare barn, and the road he had walked for ten long years.\\n\\n\\u201cWill you come?\\u201d\\n\\nThe ferryman gave a sad nod. \\u201cFor a fee.\\u201d\\n\\nTom placed his last coin on the seat. The boat slid out beneath a pale sky.\\n\\nBy noon, Tom saw a warm lamp far ahead. A woman stood by the shore.\\n\\n\\u201cYou came back,\\u201d she said.\\n\\nTom stepped onto the bank. \\u201cAt last.\\u201d\\n\\nShe took his hand, and the long road lost its hold.\", \"checks\": {\"0:keywords:letter_frequency\": false}}", "raw_metrics": {"pass_rate": {"contractDigest": "sha256:79df20ec4f4d16679ad9cae7de9a0bcc3b755edb113dc05a4458219aa4e62f53", "unit": "ratio", "status": "available", "value": 0, "evidenceRefs": ["sha256:9f0d8f373b8e2b47a89fade8fbe03621ab241cbea2cf52ed02b4767a775e9b16"]}}}}}, {"ref": {"run_id": "run_261adba7ea2e4ea0a4f241dcd6770b7f", "kind": "assessment", "digest": "sha256:776b5e60d025143153bcfb97f4df6b84a64770755a9fa7348efc1138f09926ff", "visibility": "optimization"}, "value": {"sample_id": "sha256:f162e9b9a4986e19a6a3af41850249b581517c53c0a63b5a0676a204caece2d3", "attempt_id": "sha256:bd9682af3b12f88c0b1a35b5f84c1540f8ea966d69e06712fa65a0d25584bacb", "execution_identity": "sha256:427b7d9d177e214b446561b5bc8acda0146393c567edd69fc1060fbc01d49fcc", "evidence": {"candidate_id": "anchor", "task_id": "practice-8676702945213a79069e8c132337236cc74af3b5a2c1699c919bd0fcba5accd7", "repetition": 0, "scope": "global", "status": "valid", "score": 1, "feedback": "{\"answer\": \"Subject: Kitchen Faucet Leak Repair Request\\n\\nHello [Manager\\u2019s Name],\\n\\nI\\u2019m writing to report a leaking kitchen faucet in my apartment at [address]. The leak is ongoing and may worsen if left unrepaired. Please arrange a maintenance visit at your earliest convenience.\\n\\nI\\u2019m available [preferred days/times], and you may contact me at [phone number] to coordinate access.\\n\\nTh