 Results should be compared with similar nearby areas without restoration, while also measuring disturbance from walkers, dogs, lighting, and noise. Evidence of success would include increased native-species abundance and diversity, successful breeding, movement of animals between habitats, and improved habitat quality\\u2014not simply attractive vegetation or high visitor numbers.\", \"checks\": {\"0:length_constraints:number_paragraphs\": false}}", "raw_metrics": {"pass_rate": {"contractDigest": "sha256:79df20ec4f4d16679ad9cae7de9a0bcc3b755edb113dc05a4458219aa4e62f53", "unit": "ratio", "status": "available", "value": 0, "evidenceRefs": ["sha256:e2b8791c00cb8c654d8e78661e93b9e90bbc57fdf2d7b6d4219d175701115227"]}}}}}], "data": {"prompt_path": "AGENTS.md", "current_prompt": "Follow all instructions in the user's request. Return only the requested answer.", "target_characters": 1000, "constraints": {"kind": "module", "entrypoint": "gear.search.constraints:PromptConstraints", "params": {"max_characters": 1800}, "children": {}, "source_dependencies": [], "package_dependencies": [], "resources": [], "state_schema_version": 1}}}

